  "question": {
    "text": "<p>. Match List I with List II :</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List I (Reagents used)</td>\t\t\t<td colspan=\"2\" rowspan=\"1\">List II (Compound with Functional group detected)</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A.</td>\t\t\t<td>Alkaline solution of copper sulphate and sodium citrate</td>\t\t\t<td>I.</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d3130153-0692-4959-b528-b5b6fa417b45.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 124px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B.</td>\t\t\t<td>Neutral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> solution</td>\t\t\t<td>II.</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/500acecd-e89e-4bc5-b5a5-2fc8c85b569e.png\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 87px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C.</td>\t\t\t<td>Alkaline chloroform solution</td>\t\t\t<td>III.</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/62dd3115-cd71-4c0d-9119-b371a81d5690.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 90px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D.</td>\t\t\t<td>Potassium iodide and sodium hypochloride</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5801308d-075f-4405-818a-0811629d2710.png\" style=\"width: 188px; height: 111px;\" /></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
    "image": null
